From: Prashant Singh Chauhan <prashant.singh-chauhan@broadcom.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 08:37:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Makefile: Use cython3 binary for the cython target

Signed-off-by: Prashant Singh Chauhan <prashant.singh-chauhan@broadcom.com>
---
 Makefile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 51f3e0e..e704155 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -22,7 +22,7 @@ pyupgrade:
 
 .PHONY: cython
 cython:
-	cython msgpack/_cmsgpack.pyx
+	cython3 msgpack/_cmsgpack.pyx
 
 .PHONY: test
 test: cython
